docs {
  `GET /api/v2/inventory/shopping`

  Return the shopping catalog products, with pricing, stock messages and images, that a rep or customer can buy, or a single product when productID is supplied; OData query options ($filter, $top, $orderby, $select) are supported.

  Required scope: `api/Read`

  Optional query parameters are disabled; enable the ones you need on the **Params** tab.
}
